{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:19 2026-10-19 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:19 2026-10-19 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:19 2026-10-19 HKT</p><img alt=\"「光年魅力」贏沙田錦標\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/a41ceefd0ddb1233202a0b6606b75294/2026-10/r8_3.jpg\"/><p>今日沙田賽事重頭戲，二級賽沙田錦標，「首飾天空」入閘前獨贏賠率跌至二點九倍大熱，位置賠率更跌至一點一倍，不過該駒僅跑梗頸四，反而上季爆大冷贏岀三級賽獅子山錦標的「光年魅力」再次發難，在騎師田泰安胯下以一又四分三馬位勝岀。前季田泰安和游達榮合伯成績理想，今次他們暫時合作三次，贏得兩場頭馬。</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f35d08e6ca8d098153dce5a54a463c5/2026-10/3e674925-4064-4075-b703-33dfeb20648d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5950c1c527d5d7eac681a63741217299/2026-10/4f484127-f932-484f-bf29-ad6d2a8f532a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e984854f809ed9ef6ca02ccf7db7fbb7/2026-10/6f21c5ec-7f01-49e5-b34e-2b18780d309d.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a1a0b7262f294d0f4aa20ec80253116d/2026-10/7cb6ed59-ae8d-4997-81e6-89840e646c31.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/153b04ea2fa16dc40bacad3448e55767/2026-10/8a51263f-1c3c-4102-b418-d78309471ee1.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f769001650bcf67370a5c0a2beac628/2026-10/8cace476-22c0-4cb2-bc1b-e3e229eeaba9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b819f510c9b5fe2d91000da184e3cdc1/2026-10/8f2de5f2-fbeb-4eba-823c-f304506f5770.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8be77dfc588d57c4fd0494b996879c4c/2026-10/259dad49-a073-4779-8c30-f708940d1925.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/32ab417875cd95de50de782e39b60f78/2026-10/531d24df-5914-47cf-bc6a-7b7b5b849c58.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/390a5df30914fd63106b1b93b6790af1/2026-10/906d2dc6-3900-4fbd-947d-e70dfeed6d1a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/25ff31aa0fa5ff87aa04b7e460f7cfdd/2026-10/829250b2-372d-452c-8ddb-b2320546a7cb.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f